				<flow label_side="bottom" x="433" y="234" name="deaths">
					<pts>
						<pt x="382.5" y="234"/>
						<pt x="507.5" y="234"/>
					</pts>
				</flow>
				<stock x="360" y="234" name="Rabbit Population"/>
				<connector uid="1" polarity="+" isee:polarity_placement="outside" angle="220">
					<isee:documentation>Reasoning:
A larger population of reproductive rabbits produces more total offspring per unit time.

Polarity Reasoning: 
An increase in Rabbit Population increases the rate of Births.</isee:documentation>
					<isee:reasoning>A larger population of reproductive rabbits produces more total offspring per unit time.</isee:reasoning>
					<isee:polarity_reasoning>An increase in Rabbit Population increases the rate of Births.</isee:polarity_reasoning>
