					<to>deaths</to>
				</connector>
				<connector uid="6" polarity="+" isee:polarity_placement="outside" angle="55.3297">
					<isee:documentation>Reasoning:
A higher baseline death fraction increases total mortality rate.

Polarity Reasoning: 
An increase in Fractional Death Rate increases Deaths.</isee:documentation>
					<isee:reasoning>A higher baseline death fraction increases total mortality rate.</isee:reasoning>
					<isee:polarity_reasoning>An increase in Fractional Death Rate increases Deaths.</isee:polarity_reasoning>
