				<connector uid="7" polarity="+" isee:polarity_placement="outside" angle="168.261">
					<isee:documentation>Reasoning:
Higher crowding-induced mortality pressure increases total deaths.

Polarity Reasoning: 
An increase in Effect of Crowding on Deaths increases Deaths.</isee:documentation>
					<isee:reasoning>Higher crowding-induced mortality pressure increases total deaths.</isee:reasoning>
					<isee:polarity_reasoning>An increase in Effect of Crowding on Deaths increases Deaths.</isee:polarity_reasoning>
