				</connector>
				<connector uid="8" polarity="+" isee:polarity_placement="outside" angle="260.789">
					<isee:documentation>Reasoning:
As the population grows, density relative to carrying capacity rises.

Polarity Reasoning: 
An increase in Rabbit Population increases the Crowding Ratio.</isee:documentation>
					<isee:reasoning>As the population grows, density relative to carrying capacity rises.</isee:reasoning>
					<isee:polarity_reasoning>An increase in Rabbit Population increases the Crowding Ratio.</isee:polarity_reasoning>
