				</connector>
				<connector uid="10" polarity="-" isee:polarity_placement="outside" angle="117.408">
					<isee:documentation>Reasoning:
A larger capacity dilutes density pressures for a given population size.

Polarity Reasoning: 
An increase in Carrying Capacity decreases the Crowding Ratio.</isee:documentation>
					<isee:reasoning>A larger capacity dilutes density pressures for a given population size.</isee:reasoning>
					<isee:polarity_reasoning>An increase in Carrying Capacity decreases the Crowding Ratio.</isee:polarity_reasoning>
