					<isee:documentation>Reasoning:
Greater crowding exerts negative pressure on breeding success and food availability.

Polarity Reasoning: 
An increase in Crowding Ratio decreases Effect of Crowding on Births.</isee:documentation>
					<isee:reasoning>Greater crowding exerts negative pressure on breeding success and food availability.</isee:reasoning>
					<isee:polarity_reasoning>An increase in Crowding Ratio decreases Effect of Crowding on Births.</isee:polarity_reasoning>
